      "@id": "kt:well-architected-framework",
      "@type": "kto:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Salesforce Well-Architected Framework",
      "skos:definition": "Salesforce's official architecture guidance for designing and reviewing solutions, organized since September 2026 into five pillars (Trust, Reliability, Operational Excellence, Resource and Cost Optimization, Fairness), each with an Agentic Enterprise variant; it replaced the earlier Trusted/Easy/Adaptable model.",
      "kto:domain": "architecture-practice",
